==Battleground==
*4 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You most definitely need both a meatshield and a real backliner for this stage. Most backliner Ubers should do the job, otherwise you may have to invest a decent unit such as Manic King Dragon. The stage is spammy, but as long as you have a way to deal with Sliepnir, you should come out fine.

